('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A current of 5 A flows through a 3 Ω resistor. What is the voltage across it?','[{"id":"A","text":"18 V"},{"id":"B","text":"30 V"},{"id":"C","text":"7.5 V"},{"id":"D","text":"15 V"}]'::jsonb,'D','Using V = IR, V = 5 × 3 = 15 V.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 10 Ω is connected across 30 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"6 A"},{"id":"B","text":"4 A"},{"id":"C","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"D","text":"3 A"}]'::jsonb,'D','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 30/10 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 12 Ω is connected across 48 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"4 A"},{"id":"B","text":"8 A"},{"id":"C","text":"5 A"},{"id":"D","text":"2 A"}]'::jsonb,'A','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 48/12 = 4 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 2 Ω is connected across 6 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"B","text":"3 A"},{"id":"C","text":"6 A"},{"id":"D","text":"4 A"}]'::jsonb,'B','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 6/2 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 3 Ω is connected across 9 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"B","text":"3 A"},{"id":"C","text":"6 A"},{"id":"D","text":"4 A"}]'::jsonb,'B','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 9/3 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 40 Ω is connected across 120 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"4 A"},{"id":"B","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"C","text":"3 A"},{"id":"D","text":"6 A"}]'::jsonb,'C','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 120/40 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 5 Ω is connected across 15 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"6 A"},{"id":"B","text":"4 A"},{"id":"C","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"D","text":"3 A"}]'::jsonb,'D','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 15/5 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 6 Ω is connected across 12 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"4 A"},{"id":"B","text":"3 A"},{"id":"C","text":"1 A"},{"id":"D","text":"2 A"}]'::jsonb,'D','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 12/6 = 2 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 8 Ω is connected across 24 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"4 A"},{"id":"B","text":"1.5 A"},{"id":"C","text":"3 A"},{"id":"D","text":"6 A"}]'::jsonb,'C','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 24/8 = 3 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 9 Ω is connected across 18 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"2 A"},{"id":"B","text":"4 A"},{"id":"C","text":"3 A"},{"id":"D","text":"1 A"}]'::jsonb,'A','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 18/9 = 2 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Ohm''s Law','A resistor of 9 Ω is connected across 36 V. What current flows through it?','[{"id":"A","text":"5 A"},{"id":"B","text":"2 A"},{"id":"C","text":"4 A"},{"id":"D","text":"8 A"}]'::jsonb,'C','Using Ohm''s law, I = V/R = 36/9 = 4 A.','medium','NASA Ohm''s Law','https://www.nasa.gov/stem-content/ohms-law/','authoritative-web+deterministic',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for electric charge?','[{"id":"A","text":"coulomb"},{"id":"B","text":"volt"},{"id":"C","text":"watt"},{"id":"D","text":"ohm"}]'::jsonb,'A','Electric charge is measured in coulombs (C).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for electrical current?','[{"id":"A","text":"ampere"},{"id":"B","text":"ohm"},{"id":"C","text":"volt"},{"id":"D","text":"watt"}]'::jsonb,'A','Electrical current is measured in amperes (A).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for electrical power?','[{"id":"A","text":"ampere"},{"id":"B","text":"watt"},{"id":"C","text":"volt"},{"id":"D","text":"ohm"}]'::jsonb,'B','Electrical power is measured in watts (W).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for electrical resistance?','[{"id":"A","text":"ampere"},{"id":"B","text":"volt"},{"id":"C","text":"coulomb"},{"id":"D","text":"ohm"}]'::jsonb,'D','Electrical resistance is measured in ohms (Ω).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','7f8c838f-1e73-4098-b6db-f6e3dbbf2ea3'::uuid,'Electrical Measurements','Which unit is used for potential difference?','[{"id":"A","text":"ampere"},{"id":"B","text":"watt"},{"id":"C","text":"volt"},{"id":"D","text":"ohm"}]'::jsonb,'C','Potential difference is measured in volts (V).','easy','BIPM SI units','https://www.bipm.org/documents/20126/41483022/SI-Brochure-9-concise-EN.pdf','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','A key purpose of clean water in livestock management is to support:','[{"id":"A","text":"Soil erosion"},{"id":"B","text":"Seed dormancy"},{"id":"C","text":"Health, growth and reproduction"},{"id":"D","text":"Rusting of equipment"}]'::jsonb,'C','Good feed and clean water are essential for healthy livestock growth and reproduction.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Crop rotation can help plants explore different soil layers because different crops have:','[{"id":"A","text":"Identical root systems"},{"id":"B","text":"No roots"},{"id":"C","text":"Only surface roots"},{"id":"D","text":"Different rooting depths"}]'::jsonb,'D','FAO explains that different rooting depths allow crops to explore different soil layers.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Leguminous crops can contribute to soil fertility mainly through:','[{"id":"A","text":"Increasing soil salinity"},{"id":"B","text":"Stopping root growth"},{"id":"C","text":"Biological nitrogen fixation"},{"id":"D","text":"Removing all soil nitrogen"}]'::jsonb,'C','FAO notes that legumes in rotations can add nitrogen through biological fixation.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which animal is NOT a ruminant?','[{"id":"A","text":"Cattle"},{"id":"B","text":"Chicken"},{"id":"C","text":"Goat"},{"id":"D","text":"Sheep"}]'::jsonb,'B','Chickens are not ruminants; cattle, sheep and goats are.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which combination lists nutrients animals require in their feed?','[{"id":"A","text":"Carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins and minerals"},{"id":"B","text":"Only water and salt"},{"id":"C","text":"Only protein"},{"id":"D","text":"Only carbohydrates"}]'::jsonb,'A','FAO lists carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins and minerals among required feed nutrients.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which group contains only common ruminant livestock?','[{"id":"A","text":"Chickens, ducks and turkeys"},{"id":"B","text":"Pigs, rabbits and poultry"},{"id":"C","text":"Cattle, sheep and goats"},{"id":"D","text":"Pigs, chickens and rabbits"}]'::jsonb,'C','FAO identifies cattle, sheep and goats as ruminant livestock.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which nutrient group is a major source of energy in animal feed?','[{"id":"A","text":"Carbohydrates"},{"id":"B","text":"Minerals only"},{"id":"C","text":"Water only"},{"id":"D","text":"Vitamins only"}]'::jsonb,'A','Carbohydrates are an important energy source in feed.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which nutrient is especially important as a building material for muscles in animals?','[{"id":"A","text":"Protein"},{"id":"B","text":"Water only"},{"id":"C","text":"Ash"},{"id":"D","text":"Carbon dioxide"}]'::jsonb,'A','FAO animal-health guidance describes protein as a building block needed for muscles.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which of the following is a major benefit of crop rotation?','[{"id":"A","text":"Permanent removal of all soil organisms"},{"id":"B","text":"Elimination of water needs"},{"id":"C","text":"Prevention of every plant disease"},{"id":"D","text":"Improved nutrient use and reduced pest risk"}]'::jsonb,'D','Crop rotation can improve nutrient use and reduce pest and weed risks.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which practice can improve the diversity of soil flora and fauna?','[{"id":"A","text":"Eliminating all roots"},{"id":"B","text":"Rotating different crop species"},{"id":"C","text":"Growing only one crop continuously"},{"id":"D","text":"Removing all crop residues"}]'::jsonb,'B','FAO notes that crop diversity in rotation supports diverse soil flora and fauna.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which practice helps reduce the carry-over of crop-specific pests and diseases?','[{"id":"A","text":"Continuous monocropping"},{"id":"B","text":"Overgrazing"},{"id":"C","text":"Bush burning"},{"id":"D","text":"Crop rotation"}]'::jsonb,'D','FAO notes that crop rotation helps prevent carry-over of crop-specific pests and diseases.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','93755e0f-6fbf-403a-b463-c736c0e3971b'::uuid,'Crop & Livestock Management','Which three nutrients are commonly referred to as NPK fertilizer nutrients?','[{"id":"A","text":"Nickel, phosphorus and krypton"},{"id":"B","text":"Nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium"},{"id":"C","text":"Nitrogen, protein and potassium"},{"id":"D","text":"Nitrate, phosphate and kerosene"}]'::jsonb,'B','NPK refers to nitrogen, phosphorus and potassium.','medium','FAO agricultural references','https://www.fao.org/conservation-agriculture/in-practice/species-diversification/en/','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','A current asset is generally expected to be converted to cash within:','[{"id":"A","text":"One year"},{"id":"B","text":"Ten years"},{"id":"C","text":"Fifty years"},{"id":"D","text":"No defined period"}]'::jsonb,'A','Current assets are generally expected to convert to cash within one year.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','A truck used in business operations and not held for resale is usually a:','[{"id":"A","text":"Revenue account"},{"id":"B","text":"Dividend"},{"id":"C","text":"Noncurrent/fixed asset"},{"id":"D","text":"Current liability"}]'::jsonb,'C','Operational property such as trucks is generally a fixed/noncurrent asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Inventory is generally classified as:','[{"id":"A","text":"A liability"},{"id":"B","text":"An expense only"},{"id":"C","text":"A dividend"},{"id":"D","text":"An asset"}]'::jsonb,'D','Inventory is an asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Shareholders'' equity is best described as:','[{"id":"A","text":"The company''s tax bill"},{"id":"B","text":"The residual interest after liabilities are deducted from assets"},{"id":"C","text":"All cash sales"},{"id":"D","text":"Only bank loans"}]'::jsonb,'B','Equity is the residual interest after liabilities are deducted from assets.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which equation summarises a balance sheet?','[{"id":"A","text":"Revenue = Assets + Cash"},{"id":"B","text":"Assets = Revenue - Expenses"},{"id":"C","text":"Liabilities = Cash + Sales"},{"id":"D","text":"Assets = Liabilities + Shareholders'' Equity"}]'::jsonb,'D','A balance sheet follows Assets = Liabilities + Shareholders'' Equity.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement reports cash exchanges with the outside world over a period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Cash flow statement"},{"id":"B","text":"Balance sheet only"},{"id":"C","text":"Inventory card"},{"id":"D","text":"Purchase order"}]'::jsonb,'A','The cash flow statement reports cash inflows and outflows over a period.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement shows revenues and expenses over a period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Bank mandate"},{"id":"B","text":"Income statement"},{"id":"C","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"D","text":"Share certificate"}]'::jsonb,'B','An income statement reports what a company made and spent over a period.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which financial statement shows what a company owns and owes at a specific point in time?','[{"id":"A","text":"Cash flow statement"},{"id":"B","text":"Sales invoice"},{"id":"C","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"D","text":"Income statement"}]'::jsonb,'C','A balance sheet is a point-in-time statement of assets, liabilities and equity.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which item is normally a liability?','[{"id":"A","text":"Inventory held for sale"},{"id":"B","text":"Equipment owned"},{"id":"C","text":"Amount owed to a supplier"},{"id":"D","text":"Cash in hand"}]'::jsonb,'C','Amounts owed to suppliers are liabilities.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which item is normally an asset?','[{"id":"A","text":"Bank loan payable"},{"id":"B","text":"Tax payable"},{"id":"C","text":"Trade payable"},{"id":"D","text":"Cash"}]'::jsonb,'D','Cash is an asset.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which statement is a snapshot at the end of a reporting period?','[{"id":"A","text":"Balance sheet"},{"id":"B","text":"Income statement only"},{"id":"C","text":"Cash flow statement only"},{"id":"D","text":"Sales journal"}]'::jsonb,'A','A balance sheet reports financial position at a point in time.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
('nabteb','aa0c0b77-5601-4bcc-a1fd-9259fee4579b'::uuid,'Financial Statements','Which statement shows changes in shareholders'' interests over time?','[{"id":"A","text":"Inventory requisition"},{"id":"B","text":"Statement of shareholders'' equity"},{"id":"C","text":"Purchase order"},{"id":"D","text":"Bank teller slip"}]'::jsonb,'B','The statement of shareholders'' equity shows changes in owners'' interests over time.','medium','U.S. SEC Beginner''s Guide to Financial Statements','https://www.sec.gov/files/investor/pubs/begfinstmtguide.htm','authoritative-web',now(),true,now()),
